# Offline Speech Engine Speed and Accuracy Comparison

Status: DONE
Milestone: M3 Measured recognizer selection
Dependencies: None
Reference workstream: 04_PROJECT_FOUNDATION.todo (offline benchmark does not require the app or Docker)

## Purpose

Compare actual local speech engines on identical audio instead of assuming C# or Python determines accuracy.

## Tasks

- [x] Record current architecture: C# captures/render UI; Python/Vosk already performs recognition.
- [x] Design mute-independent tests by feeding synthetic PCM directly to recognizers.
- [x] Compare installed Windows/System.Speech, Python/Vosk and offline Whisper base.en CPUint8.
- [x] Keep fixtures/normalization/error accounting identical;14harness/scoring tests pass.
- [x] Separate model load, warm decode/RTF and Vosk-only paced partial observations; no false latency comparison.
- [x] Record versions/model IDs/hashes, per-case outcomes, aggregates and limitations.
- [x] Provide repeatable private owner-corpus replay for later consented real-meeting samples.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] All3engines ran; measured values, hashes, row coverage, scoring and timing totals verified.
- [x] No speakers, microphone, loopback capture, uploads or cloud inference used.
- [x] Synthetic accuracy/batch speed are explicitly not general meeting accuracy/live latency.
- [x] Recommendation distinguishes engine/model from programming language and deployment mode.

## Completion evidence

- docs\SPEECH-BENCHMARK.md and tools\SpeechBench\results\synthetic-20261008.json.
- 32cases/164.07s/292reference words;2serial passes each: SAPI45.89%WER/10.139s,
  Vosk8.22%/41.754s, Whisperbase.en4.79%/25.745s median warm decode.
- PythonWhisper is the stronger quality candidate on this set, faster than Vosk on complete files.
  Existing Vosk streaming is retained until real chunk/refinement latency/accuracy is evaluated.
- Private receipts: .local\speech-bench\results-20261008-verified. Direct PCM works while muted.

## Completion log

- 2026-10-08 - Owner requested independent speed/accuracy tests while the laptop is muted.
- 2026-10-08 - All3local engines compared; report/replay harness complete, no live-engine replacement.
